title: NerdMiddle
---
The next day arrives. 
You meet up with the target at 11:30 and get to your seats. The show starts at exactly 12pm and runs to about 2.
You did some brief research on the show before you came. It's the story of the gods  

The story goes by.
Years before our world came, there were 10. These 10 controlled the balance of life for entries in perfect harmony. Until 2 grew tired and decided to cause chaos instead. 
Then a bunch of wars happened, blah, blah, blah.  
Personally, you have your own beliefs, but it was interesting to learn about others’ beliefs. 
The show ends, and the target and you get up to leave. 
{$target}:What did you think of the show?
->Good!
    <<set $likeness to $likeness + 5>>
->Boring
    <<set $likeness to $likeness - 5>>

Unkown: PERCEY!!!

You whip around, trying to spot who just shouted. 
From the crowd you see someone coming your way.  
{$target}:Is that B!?
The target tilts his head as the women comes closer. 
->You know her?
The woman has now broken through the crowd and is running towards you. 
{$target}: Ya!

Damn it! You think. Mission is compromised; someone has seen you with the target. 

->Run
    Your heart starts to hammer in your chest as you turn your body away from the approaching woman.

    You take a step, then another. Before you can take a third, your arm is grabbed, pulling you back.  

    You turn back to face the music. By now the woman is standing in front of you, arms crossed staring into your soul.  

    B:Who is this?
    ->I'm (insert player name)
        Gathering all your courage, you give a wave of your hand to say hello, hoping that she stops staring at you.
        B:Interesting  
        She looks you up and down, almost like she is assessing you.  
        You mirror her closed body language, trying to seem confident.  
        The Target almost noticing the tension cuts in  
        {$target}:This is B, where friends from school
